    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable; no fever, night sweats, or fatigue</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No eye pain, redness, discharge, or headache around the eyes</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing change, ringing, or ear pain</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No abdominal pain, change in bowel habit, or blood in the stool</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint or back pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing skin lesions that he has felt</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, numbness, weakness, or memory concern</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; no cravings; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm; PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No thirst or frequent urination</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
